    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polygon Survivors is a 2D survivors-style roguelite combining frantic action, deep customization, and a unique minimalist art style. Face relentless waves of enemies and build devastating loadouts in every run.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>9 different cannons</strong>, each with its own firing style and stats. Pair them with <strong>4 distinct projectile types</strong>, each offering unique effects to suit your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash Powerful Supers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and choose from <strong>9 unique supers</strong> at the start of each run\u2014each capable of turning the tide of battle. Teleportation portals, decoys, clones... every choice matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Summon to Dominate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During battle, call upon <strong>4 different summons</strong> to fight by your side. Each has a clear role (healer, damage dealer, utility, etc.) and can be upgraded to fit your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Build Your Perfect Loadout</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful <strong>power-ups</strong> (lasers, poison zones, spinning axes, and more) and upgrade your <strong>stats</strong> (speed, fire rate, damage, etc.) wave after wave. No two runs are the same\u2014experiment with dozens of combinations and grow stronger with every attempt.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polygon Survivors is a 2D survivors-style roguelite combining frantic action, deep customization, and a unique minimalist art style. Face relentless waves of enemies and build devastating loadouts in every run.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Arsenal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>9 different cannons</strong>, each with its own firing style and stats. Pair them with <strong>4 distinct projectile types</strong>, each offering unique effects to suit your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash Powerful Supers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and choose from <strong>9 unique supers</strong> at the start of each run\u2014each capable of turning the tide of battle. Teleportation portals, decoys, clones... every choice matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Summon to Dominate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During battle, call upon <strong>4 different summons</strong> to fight by your side. Each has a clear role (healer, damage dealer, utility, etc.) and can be upgraded to fit your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0Build Your Perfect Loadout</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful <strong>power-ups</strong> (lasers, poison zones, spinning axes, and more) and upgrade your <strong>stats</strong> (speed, fire rate, damage, etc.) wave after wave. No two runs are the same\u2014experiment with dozens of combinations and grow stronger with every attempt.</p>",
